    "reason": "[ev-c6ee7d3b73da] shows the unsupported v2 configuration in three forms: a YAML file (providers.docker.swarmMode: true), a TOML file ([providers.docker] swarmMode=true) and the CLI flag --providers.docker.swarmMode=true. It says this configuration \"would prevent Traefik to start\". The proposed exposure only checks the CLI flag, so it misses environments that set swarmMode in a static configuration file. The corrected condition also checks the static config file supplied through a ConfigMap.",
